  Qyl.Telemetry.SemanticConventions and .Incubating packages ship.

  Shape rules:
    * member names are the PascalCase key without its root segment (http.route -> Route); a
      dot-less key is rooted in its own namespace with the constant named after the root
    * PascalCase treats `.` and `_` identically, so distinct keys or enum ids can collapse to
      one identifier; within each class and each `…Values` class exactly one entry survives:
      the non-deprecated one, then the ordinally-first key or value
    * stable tier: stable rows plus deprecated migration symbols; incubating tier: every row.
      Enum members follow their own stability and deprecation.
-#}
